== D5-a: interval membership: TRUE [1,10) known day 2; FALSE [10,inf) known day 11
  constructor: accepted (touching half-open intervals)
  day 9 noon: fold members_at = {X}; ledgr_facts_resolve member = TRUE (member_asserted)
  day 10 noon: fold members_at = {}; ledgr_facts_resolve member = NA (unknown_no_usable_evidence)
  day 11 noon: fold members_at = {}; ledgr_facts_resolve member = FALSE (nonmember_asserted)
  (the exit on day 10 is visible on day 10 although its only encoding is knowable on day 11;
    the end date rides on the day-2 row, so the diagonal shows the exit one day before it is knowable.)

